cff-version: 1.2.0
type: dataset
title: V100 SXM2 pinout and NVLink reference
message: >-
  Please cite this curated reference kit and the upstream sources relevant to
  the information you reuse. See docs/sources.md for the original investigators
  and source projects.
authors:
  - name: Pigeon Labs
    website: https://github.com/pigeon-labs-stack
version: 0.1.0-reference
date-released: "2026-10-30"
url: https://github.com/pigeon-labs-stack/v100-sxm2-reference
repository-code: https://github.com/pigeon-labs-stack/v100-sxm2-reference
license:
  - CERN-OHL-W-2.0
  - CC-BY-SA-4.0
abstract: >-
  Curated NVIDIA V100 SXM2 connector pin mappings, source comparisons, two- and
  four-GPU NVLink connection plans, and editable connector-only KiCad starters.
  This kit presents community reference information and original curation;
  it does not claim independent reverse engineering or hardware qualification
  of every assignment. Third-party material retains its own terms.
keywords:
  - V100
  - SXM2
  - NVLink
  - pinout
  - KiCad
  - open hardware
